{"5430590":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"Fatespun","steam_appid":5430590,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fatespun is a dark fantasy card auto battler. Your hero walks a painted map, one road at a time, toward a king who hints at something older beneath his throne. You never play cards during a fight: you build a formation of cards around your hero's traits and combos, then watch it fight on its own.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every run is a loop. Plot a route through a seeded act. Spend gold and Resolve at taverns, merchants and strange events. Build a formation of variable width, where position and trait decide what a card is worth. Your cards are your units: they trade blows, take damage and fall in battle, and they grow stronger as you forge, enchant and upgrade them. Survive three rival gates built from other players' winning boards, then face the act boss and choose a Legendary reward. Fights are automatic, so the decisions that matter are the ones you make before the first blow lands.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick a hero and let them change how you build. The Wizard, Fighter, Rogue, Paladin, Ranger and Warlock each pull a different set of traits and a different kind of ending, and each hero levels up across runs, unlocking new rewards. Learn what each one wants, bend a run around it, and come back to try the next.<\/p>","about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fatespun is a dark fantasy card auto battler. Your hero walks a painted map, one road at a time, toward a king who hints at something older beneath his throne. You never play cards during a fight: you build a formation of cards around your hero's traits and combos, then watch it fight on its own.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every run is a loop. Plot a route through a seeded act. Spend gold and Resolve at taverns, merchants and strange events. Build a formation of variable width, where position and trait decide what a card is worth. Your cards are your units: they trade blows, take damage and fall in battle, and they grow stronger as you forge, enchant and upgrade them. Survive three rival gates built from other players' winning boards, then face the act boss and choose a Legendary reward. Fights are automatic, so the decisions that matter are the ones you make before the first blow lands.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick a hero and let them change how you build. The Wizard, Fighter, Rogue, Paladin, Ranger and Warlock each pull a different set of traits and a different kind of ending, and each hero levels up across runs, unlocking new rewards. Learn what each one wants, bend a run around it, and come back to try the next.<\/p>","short_description":"Choose a hero, plot a route through a haunted kingdom, and build a formation of cards that fights for you. A dark fantasy card auto battler where fights play out on their own and your cards grow as you forge and upgrade them.","supported_languages":"English<strong>*<\/strong><br><strong>*<\/strong>languages with full audio support","header_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5430590\/b1d5df50d2e7b568dc6c6a94113cd31098dcf07d\/header.jpg?t=1793728317","capsule_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5430590\/3b9f93b41f2dbd811cf4fb47e2abe37b7c83fab6\/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1793728317","capsule_imagev5":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5430590\/3b9f93b41f2dbd811cf4fb47e2abe37b7c83fab6\/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1793728317","website":"https:\/\/www.fatespun.com","pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br><\/li><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> Windows 10, 64-bit<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 8 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> A GPU with 4 GB of memory and DirectX 12<br><\/li><li><strong>DirectX:<\/strong> Version 12<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 4 GB available space<\/li><\/ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 16 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>DirectX:<\/strong> Version 12<\/li><\/ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires an Apple processor<br><\/li><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> macOS 12 (Monterey)<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> Apple silicon (M1 or later)<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 8 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> Apple M1 GPU or better (Metal)<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 4 GB available space<br><\/li><li><strong>Additional Notes:<\/strong> Apple silicon Macs only.<\/li><\/ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires an Apple processor<\/li><\/ul>"},"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><\/ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><\/ul>"},"legal_notice":" © 2026 Midnight Kitty LLC, d\/b\/a Midnight Kitty Games. All rights reserved.","developers":["Midnight Kitty"],"publishers":["Midnight Kitty"],"price_overview":{"currency":"EUR","initial":1949,"final":1461,"discount_percent":25,"initial_formatted":"19,49€","final_formatted":"14,61€"},"packages":[1874412],"package_groups":[{"name":"default","title":"Buy Fatespun","description":"","selection_text":"Select a purchase option","save_text":"","display_type":0,"is_recurring_subscription":"false","subs":[{"packageid":1874412,"percent_savings_text":"-25% ","percent_savings":0,"option_text":"Fatespun - <span class=\"discount_original_price\">19,49€<\/span> 14,61€","option_description":"","can_get_free_license":"0","is_free_license":false,"price_in_cents_with_discount":1461}]}],"platforms":{"windows":true,"mac":true,"linux":false},"categories":[{"id":2,"description":"Single-player